# The named build context of render/year-film-renderer/Dockerfile. Real
# family data never enters the image: film-data/ holds every family's
# prepared film (the sample is regenerated inside the image), and the
# composition's generated files, renders and Studio caches carry family media.
film-data/
composition/index.html
composition/compositions/
composition/assets/film/
composition/renders/
composition/snapshots/
composition/.thumbnails/
composition/.hyperframes/
composition/.waveform-cache/
composition/.sketch/
composition/storyboard.html
music/raw/
**/node_modules/
**/.DS_Store
